Package: genefox
Type: Package
Title: Client for the Shared GeneFox Scientific Runtime
Version: 1.1.2
Authors@R: person("Vindhya Data Science", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "info@vindhyadatascience.com")
Description: Access the GeneFox scientific runtime through its native C SDK or
    an optional persistent command-line transport. Preserve engine results,
    provenance and figures in ordinary R workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, digest, methods, grid, tools, stats, utils
Suggests: processx, tibble, data.table, SummarizedExperiment, S4Vectors, GenomicRanges, IRanges, png, knitr
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: C compiler; the separately installed, proprietary GeneFox
    scientific runtime (native SDK library, ABI 1) or GeneFox CLI 1.1.2 or newer.
URL: https://genefox.app/r, https://github.com/vindhyadatascience/genefox-r
BugReports: https://github.com/vindhyadatascience/genefox-r/issues
